fix: resolve Vercel build error — tsconfig.json not found at project root

- Add root tsconfig.json pointing to techcore-enterprise-portal/src
  so Vercel's build runner (which executes from repo root) can find
  TypeScript configuration without the TS5083 error
- Update vercel.json to cd into techcore-enterprise-portal before
  running npm install and npm run build, with outputDirectory
  pointing to techcore-enterprise-portal/dist
